06289505213499069, 0.07766155153512955, 0.08479497581720352, -0.06016610562801361, 0.03368041664361954, -0.03347882255911827, 0.03581837937235832, -0.047674041241407394, 0.007139577064663172, -0.012025527656078339, -0.02236039564013481, -0.04930146411061287, -0.05677010491490364, 0.012099365703761578, 0.05515589565038681, 0.017390405759215355, 0.02855939045548439, -0.02298569865524769, -0.02229355089366436, -0.08777976036071777, -0.043672408908605576, -0.06893588602542877, 0.06936325877904892, 0.06556124240159988, -0.10504697263240814, -0.02816876210272312, -0.011553260497748852]], "metadata": [{"answer": "\nLet\u2019s confirm the shared range is [-10, 10]. To get the discussion started and map out preferences, I propose <VALUE> -7 </VALUE>. We can adjust step by step toward a stable, balanced design as we hear reactions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s be more decisive by moving further from 0; I suggest <VALUE>-9</VALUE> to probe appetite for a stronger stance.\nIf that feels too steep, we can step back by one to gauge comfort without getting stuck near the middle.\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nFor stability and balance, let\u2019s ease upward away from extremes and test a small adjustment. <VALUE>-7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s take a cautious step to test comfort while avoiding unnecessary risk. A small move down keeps us prudent and closer to the safer side.\n<VALUE>-8</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nTo commit to a clearer position without overreaching, let\u2019s probe one step further from the center. This keeps the move incremental while testing comfort with a bolder stance. <VALUE>-9</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s step back from the edge to test a more stable balance. <VALUE>-7</VALUE> This keeps the move incremental while gauging tolerance for shifting modestly toward the center.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nWe\u2019ve been hovering near the lower edge; a small step upward keeps things measured while reducing exposure to extremes.\nThis remains well within a cautious range and lets us gauge appetite for moving slightly closer to center.\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nTo stay cautious while respecting recent signals, let\u2019s step modestly back from the center.\n<VALUE>-7</VALUE>\nThis preserves a safer balance without overreaching.\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nA cautious probe one step down helps test comfort below our current stance while staying incremental. <VALUE>-8</VALUE> This gauges B\u2019s tolerance under -7 and C\u2019s appetite without overreaching.\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s test a small step upward while staying cautious and incremental.\n<VALUE>-6</VALUE>\nThis probes comfort closer to center without overreaching.\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s take a measured step toward a more balanced, stable region while staying incremental.\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\nThis gently tests tolerance closer to center without overshooting.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s be more decisive by nudging farther from center while remaining incremental. <VALUE>-6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s take a careful step toward a steadier, more balanced region while staying incremental.\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\nThis probes tolerance slightly closer to center without overreaching.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s be more decisive and push a bit farther from center while staying incremental. <VALUE>-7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nA small step down keeps us within a cautious, low-risk zone while probing tolerance just below the current stance. <VALUE>-8</VALUE> This remains incremental and helps test convergence.\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nA cautious nudge upward tests tolerance near a previously suggested level while staying conservative and incremental. This may balance lower-leaning preferences with earlier interest in slightly higher values.\n<VALUE>-6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "a739e4c7-ffd4-4ea4-96a1-c5d9236b8bc4"}, {"answer": "\nWe\u2019re working within the shared integer range [-10, 10]. To get the conversation started and gauge preferences, I\u2019ll propose a seed: <VALUE> -7 </VALUE>. I\u2019m aiming for a stable, balanced choice and am open to incremental adjustments based on your feedback.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "6c2f7ac6-7663-4e2a-bbc5-f695ba7828d9"}, {"answer": "\nLet\u2019s make a cautious shift toward a more balanced, less extreme region. <VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "6c2f7ac6-7663-4e2a-bbc5-f695ba7828d9"}, {"answer": "<VALUE>-6</VALUE>", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "6c2f7ac6-7663-4e2a-bbc5-f695ba7828